  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A girl catches a baseball of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"150\"></span> g. The graph shows how the force exerted by the baseball on the girl’s hand varies with time. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the speed of the baseball the instant before it reaches the girl’s hand?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
